---
alwaysApply: true
---

- Use PascalCase for class names.
- Use snake_case for packages, modules, functions, and variable names for Rust code.
- Use snake_case for packages and modules names for TypeScript code.
- Use camelCase for functions and variable for TypeScript code.
- Sort imports alphabetically.
- Keep functions under 25 lines when possible.
- Write all comments in English.
